WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.537
&gt;&gt; CNN HAS OBTAINED A UKRAINIAN
MILITARY DOCUMENT THAT OUTLINES

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.673
THREAT POSED BY THE RUSSIAN
MERCENARY GROUP WAGNER.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:11.644
IT VIVIDLY DESCRIBES THE
BRUTALITY OF THE PRIVATE

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.547
MILITARY FORCE.
EXPLAINS HOW EFFECTIVE THE

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.716
METHODS HAVE BEEN IN EASTERN
UKRAINE.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:21.221
CNN'S FRED PLEITGEN HAS MORE ON
THIS AND A WARNING THAT HIS

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.958
REPORT CONTAINS GRAPHIC IMAGES
AND LANGUAGE.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.259
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
[SOUND OF GUNFIRE]

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:31.664
&gt;&gt; AS RUSSIA'S INVASION OF
UKRAINE FALTERS, THERE IS ONE

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.099
GROUP THAT IS HAVING SOME
SUCCESS ON THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.634
THE BRUTALLY AFFECTIVE WAGNER
PRIVATE MILITARY COMPANY, LED

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.170
BY PUTIN ALLIES, YEVGENY
PRIGOZHIN.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:46.212
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: WHY ARE WE

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.847
EFFECTIVE, AND WHERE DOES THIS
EFFECTIVELY COME FROM? WE ASK.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.115
FIRST, WE HAVE BEEN FIGHTING
FOR MANY YEARS.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.783
PROBABLY, WE ARE THE MOST
EXPERIENCED ARMY IN THE WORLD

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:53.786
TODAY.
AND, UKRAINE'S LEADERSHIP IS

00:00:53.786 --> 00:01:00.560
ALARMED BY WAGNER SUCCESS.
CNN HAS EXCLUSIVELY OBTAINED A

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.395
MILITARY DOCUMENT, OUTLINING
KYIV'S ASSESSMENT OF THE GROUP.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.930
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE ALSO PURELY
MILITARY REASONS FOR WAGNER'S

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.231
EFFECTIVENESS TO DOCUMENT, IT
SAYS.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:14.607
AS THE COMMAND STRUCTURE AND
TACTICS CURRENTLY EMPLOYED ARE

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.942
THE EARLY ONES THAT ARE
EFFECTIVE FOR THE POORLY

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:23.983
TRAINED MOBILIZED TROOPS THAT
MAKE UP THE MAJORITY OF RUSSIAN

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.218
GROUND FORCES.
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE'S MILITARY FILMED

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:26.719
THIS VIDEO SHOWING WAGNER'S
ASSAULT TACTICS USING WAVES OF

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:28.187
FIGHTERS TRYING TO OVERWHELM
AND ENCIRCLE EIGHT UKRAINIAN

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:33.226
POSITION.
THE TASKS ARE SAID TO BE AS

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:36.696
PRIMITIVE AS POSSIBLE TO
ACHIEVE THE GOAL MANY ASSAULT

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:38.264
GROUPS ARE DEPLOYED AND ATTACKS
CAN BE CARRIED OUT FOR A LONG

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:39.465
PERIOD OF TIME WITHOUT REGARD
TO LOSSES.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:43.870
THE DOCUMENT SAYS.
[SOUND OF ARTILLERY]

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:57.317
THE FIRST WAVES ARE OFTEN
CONVICTS.

00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:00.920
EVENTUALLY USED AS CANNON
FALLS.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:14.200
THE DEATH OF THOUSANDS OF
WAGNER SOLDIERS, DO NOT MATTER

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.601
TO RUSSIAN SOCIETY, THE
MILITARY DOCUMENT EXERTS AND

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.337
UNAUTHORIZED WITHDRAWAL OF A
TEAM WITHOUT BEING WINDED IS

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.571
PUNISHABLE BY EXECUTION ON THE
SPOT.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.707
YEVGENY PRIGOZHIN MAKES NO
SECRET OF THE FACT THAT LOSSES

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:28.314
DON'T MATTER TO HIM.
HE RECENTLY, VISITED A BUILDING

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:29.716
WHERE THE BODIES OF THE FALLEN
WERE KEPT.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:32.352
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
THEIR CONTRACTS HAVE ENDED,

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:45.331
THEY'RE GOING HOME, HE SAYS.
BUT PRIGOZHIN ALSO CLAIMS TO

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.599
RESPECT THE UKRAINIANS
DEFENDING AGAINST HIS

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:47.934
MERCENARIES, SAYING, THEY'RE
FIGHTING WITH VALOR.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:52.538
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: YOU NEED TO BE

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.107
MORE CAREFUL TO SEND THEM OFF
IN A DIGNIFIED MANNER, HE SAYS,

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:55.441
WHILE RECENTLY OVERSEEING AN
EXCHANGE OF BODIES BETWEEN

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.943
WAGNER AND THE UKRAINIAN ARMY.
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.144
INTERNALLY, THOUGH, IT'S A
BRUTAL REGIME.

00:02:58.144 --> 00:02:59.545
-- OR SOCIAL MEDIA CHANNEL
RECENTLY POSTED A VIDEO OF

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:00.813
MERCENARIES USING A
SLEDGEHAMMER TO KILL A FORMER

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:02.348
COMRADE WHO ALLEGEDLY DEFECTED
AND CRITICIZE THE GROUP.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:03.549
THE WORD ASSAULT ON THE
BATTLEFIELD TO.

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:04.917
UKRAINIAN INTELLIGENCE
INTERCEPTED THIS CALL, WHICH

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:06.519
CNN CANNOT INDEPENDENTLY VERIFY
OF A RUSSIAN SOLDIER TALKING TO

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:07.787
A FRIEND ABOUT WAGNER.
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:10.456
[BLEEP] [BLEEP]
[SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:11.824
[BLEEP] [SPEAKING NON-ENGLISH]
[SOUND OF ARTILLERY]

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:31.644
&gt;&gt; STILL WAGNER'S MORALE SEEMS
HIGH, THE UKRAINIANS SAY.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:36.015
AND, THE FIGHTERS ARE OFTEN
BETTER EQUIPPED THAN RUSSIA'S

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:40.920
REGULAR FORCES, THANKS TO WHAT
THE UKRAINIANS CLAIM IS U.S.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.322
MADE TECHNOLOGY.
IN CONTRAST TO THE RUSSIAN

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:45.558
ARMED FORCES, WAGNER'S MAIN --
ARE AMERICAN MADE RADIO

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:46.959
STATIONS AND MOTOROLA WALKIE
TALKIE'S, THE UKRAINIAN

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:48.060
DOCUMENTS.
AS CNN DID REACH OUT TO

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.529
MOTOROLA FOR A STATEMENT AND
THEY HAD SAID THAT, SHORTLY

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:51.030
AFTER RUSSIA INVADED UKRAINE,
THAT THEY STOPPED ALL THEIR

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.700
SALES TO BOTH RUSSIA AND TO
BELARUS AND CLOSED THEIR

00:03:54.700 --> 00:04:01.741
OPERATIONS THERE.
MEANWHILE, THOSE DOCUMENTS FROM

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.276
THE UKRAINIAN MILITARY, THERE
IS A LOT OF FASCINATING THINGS

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:10.583
IN THERE.
FOR EXAMPLE, THE UKRAINIANS SAY

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:11.984
THAT DESPITE THE INFIGHTING
THAT YOU SEE BETWEEN THE

00:04:11.984 --> 00:04:14.787
RUSSIAN DEFENSE MINISTRY AND
WAGNER, SPECIFICALLY OF YEVGENY

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.322
PRIGOZHIN, THE RUSSIAN MILITARY
IS NOW RECOMMENDING SOME OF

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:17.723
THOSE BRUTAL ASSAULT TACTICS
FROM WAGNER FROM RUSSIAN

00:04:17.723 --> 00:04:19.859
REGULAR FORCES AS WELL.
FRED PLEITGEN, CNN, KYIV.

